        <briefdescription>
<para>Homogenizes per-microplane volumetric and deviatoric values to the macroscopic tensor. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Evaluates the discrete virtual-work homogenization:    <formula id="353">\[  X_{jk} = \left( \sum_{m=1}^{n_{qp}} w^{(m)} X_V^{(m)} \right) \frac{\delta_{jk}}{3}
    + \sum_{m=1}^{n_{qp}} w^{(m)}\, Dev_{ijk}^{(m)}\, \big( X_D^{(m)} \big)_i
\]</formula> Denoting the <formula id="354">$ i $</formula>-th component of <formula id="355">$ X_D^{(m)} $</formula> by <formula id="356">$ \big( X_D^{(m)} \big)_i $</formula> (same index convention as the kinematic projection <formula id="357">$ (\varepsilon_D^{(m)})_i = Dev_{ijk}^{(m)} \varepsilon_{jk} $</formula> documented at <ref refid="struct_marmot_1_1_continuum_mechanics_1_1_microplane_1_1_v_d_split_1_1projection_tensors_1a23d8ec887f3ed5f5d65ea8ca838a28a7" kindref="member">Marmot::ContinuumMechanics::Microplane::VDSplit::projectionTensors::Dev</ref>, contracted here on  <formula id="358">$i $</formula> instead of <formula id="359">$ j,k $</formula>). <formula id="360">$ Dev^{(m)} $</formula> is <ref refid="struct_marmot_1_1_continuum_mechanics_1_1_microplane_1_1_v_d_split_1_1projection_tensors_1a23d8ec887f3ed5f5d65ea8ca838a28a7" kindref="member">Marmot::ContinuumMechanics::Microplane::VDSplit::projectionTensors::Dev</ref> for microplane <formula id="361">$ m $</formula>. This is used both to homogenize stress ( <formula id="362">$ \boldsymbol{X} = \sig $</formula>) and to homogenize strain (  <formula id="363">$ \boldsymbol{X} = \eps
$</formula>) - the method itself is agnostic to the physical meaning of <computeroutput>volValue</computeroutput> / <computeroutput>devValue</computeroutput>. <parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>volValue</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Per-microplane volumetric value <formula id="364">$ X_V^{(m)} $</formula>, size <formula id="324">$ n_{qp} \times 1 $</formula>. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>devValue</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Per-microplane deviatoric value <formula id="355">$ X_D^{(m)} $</formula>, size <formula id="322">$ n_{qp} \times 3 $</formula>. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Homogenized macroscopic tensor <formula id="365">$ X_{jk} $</formula> (3x3). </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
