      <memberdef kind="function" id="class_marmot_1_1_continuum_mechanics_1_1_microplane_1_1_v_d_split_1a1f6dcfbe1940306431789e39af8c9c81" prot="public" static="no" const="yes" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>Eigen::Matrix3d</type>
        <definition>Eigen::Matrix3d Marmot::ContinuumMechanics::Microplane::VDSplit&lt; scheme &gt;::applyProjectionTensors</definition>
        <argsstring>(const double volValue, const Eigen::Vector3d &amp;devValue, const int m) const</argsstring>
        <name>applyProjectionTensors</name>
        <qualifiedname>Marmot::ContinuumMechanics::Microplane::VDSplit::applyProjectionTensors</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type>const double</type>
          <declname>volValue</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>const Eigen::Vector3d &amp;</type>
          <declname>devValue</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>const int</type>
          <declname>m</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Applies the projection tensors of a single microplane <computeroutput>m</computeroutput> to a volumetric/deviatoric value pair, without homogenizing over all microplanes. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Computes, the (unweighted) macroscopic-space contribution of microplane <computeroutput>m</computeroutput> alone:   <formula id="366">\[  X_{jk} = X_V^{(m)} \, V_{jk} + Dev_{ijk}^{(m)}\, \big( X_D^{(m)} \big)_i
\]</formula> denoting the <formula id="354">$ i $</formula>-th component of <formula id="355">$ X_D^{(m)} $</formula> by <formula id="356">$ \big( X_D^{(m)} \big)_i $</formula> (same index convention as <ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_continuum_mechanics_1_1_microplane_1_1_v_d_split_1a30a992bd3d958b6406006406c6371e30" kindref="member">homogenize</ref> and the kinematic projection documented at <ref refid="struct_marmot_1_1_continuum_mechanics_1_1_microplane_1_1_v_d_split_1_1projection_tensors_1a23d8ec887f3ed5f5d65ea8ca838a28a7" kindref="member">Marmot::ContinuumMechanics::Microplane::VDSplit::projectionTensors::Dev</ref>). <parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>volValue</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Volumetric value <formula id="364">$ X_V^{(m)} $</formula> of microplane <computeroutput>m</computeroutput>. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>devValue</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Deviatoric value <formula id="355">$ X_D^{(m)} $</formula> of microplane <computeroutput>m</computeroutput>. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>m</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Index of the microplane. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>The 3x3 tensor contribution <formula id="365">$ X_{jk} $</formula> of microplane <computeroutput>m</computeroutput>. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
